r.\r\n\r\nReproduction:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nx = jax.device_put(0, jax.devices('cpu')[0])\r\n\r\n\r\nwith jax.transfer_guard('disallow'):\r\n  x + 0  # XlaRuntimeError\r\n```\r\n\r\n`x + 0` raise:\r\n\r\n```\r\nXlaRuntimeError: INVALID_ARGUMENT: Disallowed host-to-device transfer: aval=ShapedArray(int32[]), dst_sharding=GSPMDSharding({replicated})\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt looks like `0` gets converted to REPLICATED array before, so `x + 0` trigger a transfer.\r\n\r\nMight be related to:\r\n* https://github.com/google/jax/issues/16002\r\n* https://github.com/google/jax/issues/16602\r\n\r\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\r\n\r\nHEAD\r\n","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18436/comments","created_at":"2023-11-08T16:04:41Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18436/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/18436","id":1983937573,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18436/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc52QHwl","number":18436,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18436/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","state":"open","state_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18436/timeline","title":"Using CPU array raise Disallow